  "MOLE_OFFICE_RUN_MESSAGES": "How many messages one agent run may file through the message worker before it is refused.",
  "MOLE_OFFICE_RUN_WAITS_MINUTES": "How many minutes a run that has answered waits for the next message before its conversation ends.",
  "MOLE_OFFICE_IDLE_REMINDER_HOURS": "F13: how many hours an agent may go with nothing sent or received before the office reminds it of its role and duties, once per idle spell.",
  "MOLE_OFFICE_BROADCAST_TIMES": "The times of day a secretary broadcasts to the person, as a comma-separated list of HH:MM in local time.",
