  "MOLE_OFFICE_BROADCAST_UNANSWERED_LIMIT": "How many of a secretary’s broadcasts in a row may go unanswered by the person before the office pauses the schedule. 0 is off, and off is the default: the office never pauses it.",
  "MOLE_OFFICE_BROADCAST_BACKUP_REMINDER": "The sentence the office adds to a secretary’s last broadcast reminder of the day, so that once a day a secretary checks that today’s work has a second copy.",
