  "MOLE_OFFICE_ADDRESS_FOR_OTHER_MACHINES": "The name or address your other machines reach this computer at, on your own private network. Mole Office listens on it as well as on 127.0.0.1 when you set it.",
  "MOLE_OFFICE_VISITOR_CARD_CEILING": "The highest role card a visitor may hold. A visitor comes in through the Embassy on a credential, and the card its credential asks for is refused above this one.",
  "MOLE_OFFICE_IDLE_AFTER": "How long a session may be quiet before it reads as idle.",
